=== Episode 3: Desserts ===
For their signature challenge, the bakers were asked to make a trifle of their own choice, using [[Ladyfinger (biscuit)|ladyfingers]], sponge or biscuit for the base and either jam or custard for the middle layer, to be done in 3 hours. For their technical challenge, the bakers were required to prepare, in {{frac|1|1|2}} hours, 6 [[Floating island (dessert)|floating islands]] using Mary Berry's recipe. For the show-stopper, the bakers were set the task of making 24 [[petit fours]], 12 biscuit based, and 12 sponge based, to be finished in 3 hours.

