=== Episode 7: Pastry ===
The bakers are challenged to bring the old fashioned [[suet pudding]] back up to date in 3 hours for the signature challenge. In the technical bake, the bakers are challenged to create 8 perfect [[religieuse]]: [[Choux pastry|choux]] buns topped with ganache and filled with crème patissiere then carefully balanced one on top of the other to be done in 2 hours. In the showstopper challenge, the bakers have 4 hours to make 3 different types of [[Puff pastry|puff pastries]]: one filled, one iced and one of their choice.{{sticky header}}{{table alignment}}
